r\n- remove 3 unused variables from the rendering shader compiler\r\n- update `ProjectSettings.xml` appropriately\r\n\r\n### Details\r\n\r\nThe following 4 project settings:\r\n\r\n- rendering/shader_compiler/shader_cache/compress\r\n- rendering/shader_compiler/shader_cache/strip_debug\r\n- rendering/shader_compiler/shader_cache/strip_debug.release\r\n- rendering/shader_compiler/shader_cache/use_zstd_compression\r\n\r\nall refer to variables whose logic was removed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/50847. As far as I can tell the variables created from these settings are unaccessed (`strip_debug.release` is never accessed, the others are accessed but then placed into unused variables).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/